## 🔒 Security Considerations

### Playwright MCP
```bash
# Production configuration
npx @playwright/mcp \
  --allowed-hosts=example.com,trusted-site.com \
  --caps=testing  # Enable only needed caps

# Run in container for isolation
docker run --rm \
  -e ALLOWED_HOSTS=example.com \
  playwright-mcp
```

**Risks:** Low (browser-scoped only)

### browser-use MCP
```bash
# Run in sandbox (privileged access!)
# Can access filesystem and execute arbitrary commands

# Mitigation:
docker run --rm \
  --read-only \
  --network=none \
  browser-use-mcp
```

**Risks:** High (filesystem access, needs sandboxing)

**Best Practice:**
- Run browser-use in isolated container
- Limit file system access
- Use network policies
- Monitor for suspicious activity

